From 473589bbef92295af4ef4e297020ad494ae98138 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 13:58:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add motion and editorial asymmetry: scroll reveals, parallax
 hero, asymmetric portfolio mosaic

- Progressive-enhancement scroll-reveal system (IntersectionObserver + CSS,
  fully visible without JS, respects prefers-reduced-motion)
- Hero: slow Ken Burns zoom + subtle scroll parallax on the placeholder image
- Portfolio grid: asymmetric zig-zag mosaic (varying tile spans/ratios) with
  hover image-zoom instead of a uniform 3-col grid
- About/why-us/process grids: alternating brick-offset rhythm instead of a
  flat aligned grid
- RuleDivider: thin rule draws in on scroll
- Button/nav: hover lift and center-out underline micro-interactions
